# Line endings are normalized to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# The tree was committed with a mix of CRLF and LF, so every `cargo fmt` pass
# produced whole-file diffs that buried the real change. `* text=auto eol=lf`
# makes Git store and check out LF regardless of platform; `.editorconfig`
# tells editors the same thing.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures must reach the parser exactly as committed; Git must not rewrite
# their line endings on checkout, or the round-trip tests become platform
# dependent.
fixtures/** -text

# Binary assets Git should never inspect for line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.ttf binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
